बन्धं मोक्षं च या वेत्ति बुद्धि: सा पार्थ सात्त्विकी ॥ ३० ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":4610,\"bb\":4040,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/30/b4040/\",\"body_value\":\"pravṛttiṁ ca nivṛttiṁ ca
kāryākārye bhayābhaye
bandhaṁ mokṣaṁ ca yā vetti
buddhiḥ sā pārtha sāttvikī\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4611,\"bb\":4041,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/30/b4041/\",\"shadow_value\":\"pravṛttim – doing; ca – also; nivṛttim – not doing; ca – and; kārya – what ought to be done; akārye – and what ought not to be done; bhaya – fear; abhaye – and fearlessness; bandham – bondage; mokṣam – liberation; ca – and; yā – that which; vetti – knows; buddhiḥ – understanding; sā – that; pārtha – O son of Pṛthā; sāttvikī – in the mode of goodness.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"pravṛttim\",\"translation\":\"doing\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"nivṛttim\",\"translation\":\"not doing\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"kārya\",\"translation\":\"what ought to be done\"},{\"word\":\"akārye\",\"translation\":\"and what ought not to be done\"},{\"word\":\"bhaya\",\"translation\":\"fear\"},{\"word\":\"abhaye\",\"translation\":\"and fearlessness\"},{\"word\":\"bandham\",\"translation\":\"bondage\"},{\"word\":\"mokṣam\",\"translation\":\"liberation\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"and\"},{\"word\":\"yā\",\"translation\":\"that which\"},{\"word\":\"vetti\",\"translation\":\"knows\"},{\"word\":\"buddhiḥ\",\"translation\":\"understanding\"},{\"word\":\"sā\",\"translation\":\"that\"},{\"word\":\"pārtha\",\"translation\":\"O son of Pṛthā\"},{\"word\":\"sāttvikī\",\"translation\":\"in the mode of goodness\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4612,\"bb\":4042,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/30/b4042/\",\"body_value\":\"O son of Pṛthā, that understanding by which one knows what ought to be done and what ought not to be done, what is to be feared and what is not to be feared, what is binding and what is liberating, is in the mode of goodness.\"}]},{\"