manyate tamasāvṛtā
sarvārthān viparītāṁś ca
buddhiḥ sā pārtha tāmasī\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4622,\"bb\":4050,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/32/b4050/\",\"shadow_value\":\"adharmam – irreligion; dharmam – religion; iti – thus; yā – which; manyate – thinks; tamasā – by illusion; āvṛtā – covered; sarva-arthān – all things; viparītān – in the wrong direction; ca – also; buddhiḥ – intelligence; sā – that; pārtha – O son of Pṛthā; tāmasī – in the mode of ignorance.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"adharmam\",\"translation\":\"irreligion\"},{\"word\":\"dharmam\",\"translation\":\"religion\"},{\"word\":\"iti\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"yā\",\"translation\":\"which\"},{\"word\":\"manyate\",\"translation\":\"thinks\"},{\"word\":\"tamasā\",\"translation\":\"by illusion\"},{\"word\":\"āvṛtā\",\"translation\":\"covered\"},{\"word\":\"sarva-arthān\",\"translation\":\"all things\"},{\"word\":\"viparītān\",\"translation\":\"in the wrong direction\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"buddhiḥ\",\"translation\":\"intelligence\"},{\"word\":\"sā\",\"translation\":\"that\"},{\"word\":\"pārtha\",\"translation\":\"O son of Pṛthā\"},{\"word\":\"tāmasī\",\"translation\":\"in the mode of ignorance\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4623,\"bb\":4051,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/32/b4051/\",\"body_value\":\"That understanding which considers irreligion to be religion and religion to be irreligion, under the spell of illusion and darkness, and strives always in the wrong direction, O Pārtha, is in the mode of ignorance.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4624,\"bb\":4052,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/32/b4052/\",\"body_value\":\"Intelligenc