dhṛtiḥ sā pārtha sāttvikī\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4628,\"bb\":4055,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/33/b4055/\",\"shadow_value\":\"dhṛtyā – determination; yayā – by which; dhārayate – one sustains; manaḥ – of the mind; prāṇa – life; indriya – and senses; kriyāḥ – the activities; yogena – by yoga practice; avyabhicāriṇyā – without any break; dhṛtiḥ – determination; sā – that; pārtha – O son of Pṛthā; sāttvikī – in the mode of goodness.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"dhṛtyā\",\"translation\":\"determination\"},{\"word\":\"yayā\",\"translation\":\"by which\"},{\"word\":\"dhārayate\",\"translation\":\"one sustains\"},{\"word\":\"manaḥ\",\"translation\":\"of the mind\"},{\"word\":\"prāṇa\",\"translation\":\"life\"},{\"word\":\"indriya\",\"translation\":\"and senses\"},{\"word\":\"kriyāḥ\",\"translation\":\"the activities\"},{\"word\":\"yogena\",\"translation\":\"by yoga practice\"},{\"word\":\"avyabhicāriṇyā\",\"translation\":\"without any break\"},{\"word\":\"dhṛtiḥ\",\"translation\":\"determination\"},{\"word\":\"sā\",\"translation\":\"that\"},{\"word\":\"pārtha\",\"translation\":\"O son of Pṛthā\"},{\"word\":\"sāttvikī\",\"translation\":\"in the mode of goodness\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4629,\"bb\":4056,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/33/b4056/\",\"body_value\":\"O son of Pṛthā, that determination which is unbreakable, which is sustained with steadfastness by yoga practice, and which thus controls the activities of the mind, life and senses is determination in the mode of goodness.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4630,\"bb\":4057,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/33/b4057/\",\"body_value\":\"Yoga 