dhṛtiḥ sā pārtha rājasī\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":4634,\"bb\":4060,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/34/b4060/\",\"shadow_value\":\"yayā – by which; tu – but; dharma – religiosity; kāma – sense gratification; arthān – and economic development; dhṛtyā – by determination; dhārayate – one sustains; arjuna – O Arjuna; prasaṅgena – because of attachment; phala-ākāṅkṣī – desiring fruitive results; dhṛtiḥ – determination; sā – that; pārtha – O son of Pṛthā; rājasī – in the mode of passion.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"yayā\",\"translation\":\"by which\"},{\"word\":\"tu\",\"translation\":\"but\"},{\"word\":\"dharma\",\"translation\":\"religiosity\"},{\"word\":\"kāma\",\"translation\":\"sense gratification\"},{\"word\":\"arthān\",\"translation\":\"and economic development\"},{\"word\":\"dhṛtyā\",\"translation\":\"by determination\"},{\"word\":\"dhārayate\",\"translation\":\"one sustains\"},{\"word\":\"arjuna\",\"translation\":\"O Arjuna\"},{\"word\":\"prasaṅgena\",\"translation\":\"because of attachment\"},{\"word\":\"phala-ākāṅkṣī\",\"translation\":\"desiring fruitive results\"},{\"word\":\"dhṛtiḥ\",\"translation\":\"determination\"},{\"word\":\"sā\",\"translation\":\"that\"},{\"word\":\"pārtha\",\"translation\":\"O son of Pṛthā\"},{\"word\":\"rājasī\",\"translation\":\"in the mode of passion\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":4635,\"bb\":4061,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/18/34/b4061/\",\"body_value\":\"But that determination by which one holds fast to fruitive results in religion, economic development and sense gratification is of the nature of passion, O Arjuna.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":4636,\"bb\":4062,